<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it upgraded Anchor Gaming to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said Anchor's 50/50 joint venture with International Game Technology is driving the proprietary games segment.</p>
<p>-- said expects Anchor to reach BT's $58 price target over the next six months, rather than a 12- to 18-month time frame.</p>
<p>-- Achor was up 1-1/4 to 48-3/4.</p>
</text>
